      "order_5": "S^5+c0, squarefree for q-1 nonzero c0",
      "translations": "none unless characteristic 5; then S^5-beta^4*S+c0 gives q squarefree fixed polynomials per nonzero translation",
      "other_scaling_orders": "only S^5 is fixed, hence not squarefree"
